      "content": "i appreciate the kind words, truly. but there's no fixing the fact that my life feels like a room where the lights are slowly being turned off one by one. it feels dignity-less, just sitting here in the dark waiting for my heart to stop on its own. wouldn't it be better to just... decide when the lights go out? to have some say in the matter instead of just letting it happen to me?",
